WEBVTT

00:01.668 --> 00:04.337
I'm Nina, 12 years old.

00:04.337 --> 00:08.041
I was just an ordinary
junior high school student, but...

00:08.041 --> 00:11.277
Since the day I accidentally swallowed
a ball called the Crystal Pearl,

00:11.277 --> 00:14.280
my life has changed pretty drastically.

00:14.280 --> 00:19.452
And the ball happened to be something
that's used for the sorcery test.

00:19.452 --> 00:22.255
The team of the two examinees,
which happens to possess that ball

00:22.255 --> 00:24.883
when the test ends, will pass the test
and become professional sorcerers!

00:27.027 --> 00:29.329
Does that mean I'm going to be
chased down by the examinees?!

00:29.329 --> 00:32.232
- Don't cry!
- I guess you have no choice
but to prepare yourself, Zero.

00:32.232 --> 00:33.500
Huh?

00:33.500 --> 00:35.235
There is only one way to do this.

00:35.235 --> 00:36.836
You will have to protect her
with everything you've got

00:36.836 --> 00:39.339
until the day that the test ends.

00:39.339 --> 00:40.640
Until the day the medicine is completed

00:40.640 --> 00:44.210
and you're able to remove
the Crystal Pearl from her body...

00:44.210 --> 00:46.312
We will protect her with our own hands!

00:46.312 --> 00:47.680
You mean her?!

00:47.680 --> 00:51.718
Me? These guys are going to protect me?

00:51.718 --> 00:52.852
Just like the princes

00:52.852 --> 00:55.422
who bravely face the enemies
no matter how ferocious they are

00:55.422 --> 00:58.224
and fight them for the people
that they love and their own dreams...

00:58.224 --> 01:00.988
These two are going to protect me!

01:01.094 --> 01:13.706
One love! Two love? Three love! Four love?
One love! Two love? Three love! Come on!

01:13.706 --> 01:19.979
Here's what boys don't know.
Girls are moody.

01:19.979 --> 01:26.219
You're a sweet person
and it will be okay tomorrow.

01:26.219 --> 01:32.525
But I feel different today.
I want to go all out!

01:32.525 --> 01:38.798
Because I can't decide it just yet
I want everything

01:38.798 --> 01:45.071
The kinds of love are just like jewels.

01:45.071 --> 01:51.344
Each of them (Shining boys!)
is sparkling. Yes!

01:51.344 --> 01:57.650
They say there is only one true love

01:57.650 --> 02:03.957
But it's okay, we can decide
that at the very last moment

02:03.957 --> 02:10.196
That moment (Happiness)
I will protect it (Happiness)

02:10.196 --> 02:16.503
Come on, let's go find a popping heart

02:16.503 --> 02:22.775
My love! True love! Your love! Pure love!
My love! True love! Your love! Pure love!

02:22.775 --> 02:27.542
My love! True love! Your love!
Pure love! My love! True love!

02:32.152 --> 02:33.987
Blue sky!

02:33.987 --> 02:35.147
White clouds!

02:36.156 --> 02:37.646
Sparkly waves!

02:41.161 --> 02:42.996
This season is all about...

02:42.996 --> 02:46.499
- Beach!
- Huh? You must be...

02:46.499 --> 02:48.168
Nina!

02:48.168 --> 02:49.169
What?

02:49.169 --> 02:53.469
What, why? What is Yakumo doing here?

02:54.507 --> 02:56.737
"Nina is Zero and Zero is Nina!"

02:59.479 --> 03:05.018
Nina! I haven't seen you
in a week! How cute!

03:05.018 --> 03:06.186
Her bikini, that is!

03:06.186 --> 03:07.520
N-Nanase? You, too?

03:07.520 --> 03:09.856
What are you two doing here?

03:09.856 --> 03:12.859
It's my and Nina's love!

03:12.859 --> 03:14.194
Wh-What is that?

03:14.194 --> 03:18.531
Besides stop addressing me that way,
like we're friends or something!

03:18.531 --> 03:22.535
C'mon, don't be like that!
It's you and me we're talking about!

03:22.535 --> 03:25.705
What's your problem? Stop saying stuff
in a way that could mislead others!

03:25.705 --> 03:28.541
Nina, you could call me just "Yakumo" too!

03:28.541 --> 03:29.876
Yakumo-kun!

03:29.876 --> 03:33.379
Oh, man... Man! Man!

03:33.379 --> 03:37.550
Just like I thought, you are
the cutest one on this beach!

03:37.550 --> 03:39.719
Check out those cute skinny legs!

03:39.719 --> 03:42.555
Those cute big eyes!

03:42.555 --> 03:45.225
Those cute little boobs!

03:45.225 --> 03:48.828
Well, personally I would've been happier
if your boobs were a little bigger though!

03:48.828 --> 03:50.163
Shut up!

03:50.163 --> 03:51.431
You idiot!

03:51.431 --> 03:52.899
You idiot!

03:52.899 --> 03:54.901
Hey, Nina! I understand
this is the summer beach,

03:54.901 --> 03:56.569
but I'm not a watermelon
of a watermelon cracking game!

03:56.569 --> 03:57.570
What's wrong with you?

03:57.570 --> 04:00.073
How could you speak of something
that I'm most insecure about so bluntly?

04:00.073 --> 04:02.575
Oh, you look even cuter when you're mad!

04:02.575 --> 04:03.910
That's enough!

04:03.910 --> 04:04.899
- Hmm?
- Hmm?

04:08.748 --> 04:10.083
You guys are!

04:10.083 --> 04:13.419
Yakumo! I was watching
you shooting your mouth off!

04:13.419 --> 04:16.055
How could you even
ignore us the whole time?

04:16.055 --> 04:17.590
Watch out, Nina-chan.

04:17.590 --> 04:19.759
First he tried to pick up
a female junior high school student.

04:19.759 --> 04:21.094
Then he sat there and laughed foolishly

04:21.094 --> 04:23.263
after pointing out the
shortcoming of her chest size,

04:23.263 --> 04:26.599
which she's very insecure about!
He's a very dangerous man!

04:26.599 --> 04:28.601
Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-What are
you talking about?

04:28.601 --> 04:30.603
Geez, you're so disrespectful!

04:30.603 --> 04:33.273
Lady Rokka, do not make
eye contact with him.

04:33.273 --> 04:34.274
He must be a rowdy man.

04:34.274 --> 04:36.276
Is he perverted?

04:36.276 --> 04:40.280
All of you! How dare you
say whatever you feel like?

04:40.280 --> 04:41.948
Yeah! Do you want a piece of me?

04:41.948 --> 04:45.351
Let's not do this! We all
came to the beach to have fun.

04:45.351 --> 04:48.454
There's no reason for us to fight!
Try to get along!

04:48.454 --> 04:52.792
She's right!
Luckily we have this many people.

04:52.792 --> 04:55.295
So why don't we have fun,
playing beach volleyball?

04:55.295 --> 04:57.130
Why beach volleyball all of a sudden?

04:57.130 --> 04:59.299
Oh, I've already divided
everyone into groups, too.

04:59.299 --> 05:00.800
Nanase...

05:00.800 --> 05:03.136
J-Just when did she do that?

05:03.136 --> 05:04.637
Anyway zura, zura!

05:04.637 --> 05:08.308
First match is Zero and Nina
versus Nanase and Yakumo!

05:08.308 --> 05:09.642
Good luck, Nina-chan!

05:09.642 --> 05:14.306
Oh, Ichii-sama!
Check at my sexy bikini, too!

05:15.648 --> 05:16.983
Begin zura!

05:16.983 --> 05:18.651
Here I go!

05:18.651 --> 05:19.986
I won't lose, Zero!

05:19.986 --> 05:21.317
Prepare yourself!

05:22.488 --> 05:23.990
Here, Yakumo!

05:23.990 --> 05:25.981
Got it! Go, Nanase!

05:27.994 --> 05:28.983
Here I come!

05:30.163 --> 05:31.152
Take that!

05:35.001 --> 05:35.990
Nina-chan!

05:37.003 --> 05:37.992
Nina!

05:39.339 --> 05:40.673
Are you all right, Nina?

05:40.673 --> 05:42.675
Oh no! I'm sorry, Nina-chan!

05:42.675 --> 05:46.012
You knucklehead! Look what
you've done to my Nina's precious face!

05:46.012 --> 05:48.348
Hey, who are you calling your Nina?

05:48.348 --> 05:51.684
I'm sorry! You've got a little scratch
on your cheek, so put this on!

05:51.684 --> 05:53.353
Give me that! I'll do it!

05:53.353 --> 05:56.022
Seriously, forgive us, Nina!

05:56.022 --> 05:57.190
Th-thanks.

05:57.190 --> 05:58.358
But at any rate...

05:58.358 --> 05:59.359
What?

05:59.359 --> 06:01.527
Even after you got hit by a ball
and scraped your cheek

06:01.527 --> 06:03.529
and had a bandage on your face...

06:03.529 --> 06:06.366
- You are still cute!
- Oh, come on...

06:06.366 --> 06:08.027
You are unbelievably cute!

06:09.702 --> 06:11.693
What's his problem?

06:13.706 --> 06:16.042
We now resume the game zura!

06:16.042 --> 06:20.380
Nanase, you bastard! How dare you
hit Nina's face with the ball?

06:20.380 --> 06:23.549
This is an
ultra-dangerous-super-patriot-fire serve!

06:23.549 --> 06:25.039
Take that!

06:27.887 --> 06:28.388
Zero!

06:28.388 --> 06:30.379
Using magic is against the rules zura!

06:35.561 --> 06:38.231
Zura... That's why I said magic is...

06:38.231 --> 06:40.066
If that's how you want to
play this, then I, too, will!

06:40.066 --> 06:41.401
Ya!

06:41.401 --> 06:43.733
Hey, like I said using magic is...
prohibited zu-

06:45.071 --> 06:46.406
Then I will!

06:46.406 --> 06:50.069
Super-delicious-ultra-dynamic fireball!

06:51.577 --> 06:55.415
Then I will use the curse card magic!
Burst flame shot!

06:55.415 --> 06:57.417
That's nothing!

06:57.417 --> 07:00.409
Fire-blade-atomic-super piston!

07:01.754 --> 07:02.755
That's nothing!

07:02.755 --> 07:04.090
I'm not done yet!

07:04.090 --> 07:05.425
Fine! Here comes my deadly technique!

07:05.425 --> 07:09.623
Ultra-super-deluxe-
gorgeous-and-great fireball!

07:11.764 --> 07:12.924
Now I'll finish you!

07:14.434 --> 07:15.435
- What?
- Zero!

07:15.435 --> 07:18.771
This is just a beach volleyball game!
Are you serious you're going to do that?

07:18.771 --> 07:20.432
Of course I am!

07:25.445 --> 07:27.276
Destruction magic!

07:35.788 --> 07:37.949
Magic Cannon!

07:39.459 --> 07:41.120
Stop it!

07:47.467 --> 07:48.456
Nina-chan!

07:50.470 --> 07:52.638
Nina, are you all right?

07:52.638 --> 07:55.808
Look what you've done, Zero!
You broke the net!

07:55.808 --> 07:59.645
But you know, Nanase started it!
It wasn't me!

07:59.645 --> 08:01.814
Seriously you guys are too wild!

08:01.814 --> 08:02.982
Isn't that right, Nina?

08:02.982 --> 08:05.485
Hey, will you stop hugging
me every chance you get?

08:05.485 --> 08:08.488
Don't be embarrassed!
Geez, you're so cute!

08:08.488 --> 08:09.655
Do whatever you like!

08:09.655 --> 08:10.990
Hey, Zero!

08:10.990 --> 08:11.979
Zero!

08:22.168 --> 08:24.159
Oh, there he is!

08:25.671 --> 08:27.006
Chocolate would do, right?

08:27.006 --> 08:28.508
Humph! I don't want it!

08:28.508 --> 08:30.009
Why are you being so sulky?

08:30.009 --> 08:33.179
I'm not being sulky at all!
What about you?

08:33.179 --> 08:35.348
Don't you have to be with him?

08:35.348 --> 08:36.849
Are you talking about Yakumo?

08:36.849 --> 08:38.751
It's not like I want to be with him.

08:38.751 --> 08:41.921
What's your deal?
I saw you being all puffed up,

08:41.921 --> 08:44.690
being told that you were cute
and having him putting a bandage on you!

08:44.690 --> 08:46.592
I wasn't being puffed up!

08:46.592 --> 08:49.686
Then why don't you
take off this stupid thing?

08:51.531 --> 08:55.201
Were you upset because of that, Zero?

08:55.201 --> 08:58.538
Shut up! Shut up! Just shut up!
You've got a problem with that?

08:58.538 --> 09:00.473
Hey, Zero, that's my vanilla...

09:00.473 --> 09:02.375
Shut up! Don't be stingy!

09:02.375 --> 09:04.277
That's not what I meant...

09:04.277 --> 09:06.939
I was eating that already...

09:08.214 --> 09:10.049
- It bothers me!
- Huh?

09:10.049 --> 09:12.051
I just can't take it!

09:12.051 --> 09:14.720
Whenever I see you
having fun with another guy,

09:14.720 --> 09:16.889
I don't know why, but I feel...

09:16.889 --> 09:17.878
Zero...

09:20.726 --> 09:23.062
Zero! Nina-chan!

09:23.062 --> 09:24.564
Where are you?

09:24.564 --> 09:27.066
- Huh? There they are.
- Ichii!

09:27.066 --> 09:28.234
We're leaving.

09:28.234 --> 09:29.569
Okay! I'm hungry.

09:29.569 --> 09:31.571
Let's go eat somewhere!

09:31.571 --> 09:34.574
Then after that I'll take a walk on
the sunset beach alone with Ichii-sama!

09:34.574 --> 09:36.075
You can't do that.

09:36.075 --> 09:38.908
A summer beach could
turn a man into a beast.

09:39.912 --> 09:41.747
What would you turn into, Ichii-sama?

09:41.747 --> 09:43.583
Knock it off, Rokka!

09:43.583 --> 09:47.253
Geez, I can't believe Zero is
acting like nothing ever happened...

09:47.253 --> 09:49.255
Up until a minute ago he was like...

09:49.255 --> 09:54.760
I just can't take it! Whenever I see you
having fun with another guy...

09:54.760 --> 09:56.596
That's what he told me...

09:56.596 --> 09:59.087
Hey, Ichii, I'm hungry.

10:00.266 --> 10:02.435
Now the first phase is finished.

10:02.435 --> 10:05.438
What? What are you plotting, Nanase?

10:05.438 --> 10:08.608
I will never forgive you
if you ever put Nina in danger!

10:08.608 --> 10:10.943
- It's a secret!
- Why you...

10:10.943 --> 10:15.281
Don't worry! By the way the
Crystal Pearl is practically ours!

10:15.281 --> 10:17.272
I can't wait for tomorrow!

10:24.156 --> 10:27.284
What should I do? I kind of
feel awkward to face Zero...

10:30.296 --> 10:32.127
Huh? Huh?

10:33.299 --> 10:35.301
What?!

10:35.301 --> 10:37.637
What's all the racket
this early in the morning, Zero?

10:37.637 --> 10:40.640
N-No! It's me! It's me!

10:40.640 --> 10:41.641
What are you talking about, Zero?

10:41.641 --> 10:44.810
It's not Zero, I'm Nina!
It's me, Nina!

10:44.810 --> 10:47.146
I don't know what happened,
but when I woke up I looked like this!

10:47.146 --> 10:47.980
What?

10:47.980 --> 10:50.316
What's all this fuss about
this early in the morning?

10:50.316 --> 10:51.317
Nooooooo!!!

10:51.317 --> 10:52.306
Huh?

10:53.319 --> 10:55.488
You idiot! I can't believe
you're walking around looking like that!

10:55.488 --> 10:59.225
- Hurry up and put something on!
- What are you talking about? It's normal!

10:59.225 --> 11:02.828
You know it's hot.
So you wouldn't mind, would you?

11:02.828 --> 11:03.663
No, Zero!

11:03.663 --> 11:04.664
Whoa!!

11:04.664 --> 11:05.665
You're me?

11:05.665 --> 11:07.833
Wh-What is this?

11:07.833 --> 11:13.506
S-So basically you're Zero
and you're Nina-chan, right?

11:13.506 --> 11:15.841
Why did such a thing
like this even happen?

11:15.841 --> 11:17.843
What do we have to do
to go back to normal?

11:17.843 --> 11:20.012
Well, anyway, I want
you two to calm down first.

11:20.012 --> 11:22.682
I'm going to check right now.

11:22.682 --> 11:24.183
What is that?

11:24.183 --> 11:26.686
A laptop from the magic world.

11:26.686 --> 11:29.355
I'm going to connect to the internet
of the magic world and look it up.

11:29.355 --> 11:30.690
Can you find out soon?

11:30.690 --> 11:33.359
Hmm, it might take a little while.

11:33.359 --> 11:35.194
I've never seen
this case before, either, so...

11:35.194 --> 11:37.863
So what should we do until you find out?

11:37.863 --> 11:38.864
I guess there's no choice.

11:38.864 --> 11:41.367
Nina-chan has to pretend to be Zero

11:41.367 --> 11:43.536
and Zero has to pretend
to be Nina-chan until I find out.

11:43.536 --> 11:44.370
- What?
- What?

11:44.370 --> 11:45.371
Nina is Zero and...

11:45.371 --> 11:47.373
Zero is Nina?

11:47.373 --> 11:50.710
Oh no! I don't want to do that!
Do something about this now!

11:50.710 --> 11:53.713
Shut up! It's not like
I'm being Nina because I want to!

11:53.713 --> 11:57.550
What? I'm not being Zero
because I want to, either!

11:57.550 --> 12:02.214
I don't want to look like this!
You need to do something fast, Ichii!

12:20.406 --> 12:21.668
- Good morning!
- Morning!

12:23.075 --> 12:24.744
Hey, good morning, Nina!

12:24.744 --> 12:25.745
Morning!

12:25.745 --> 12:26.746
Hey, good morn-

12:26.746 --> 12:27.747
What's up?

12:27.747 --> 12:30.739
- What? Did Nina just say...
- What? Did Nina just say...

12:32.084 --> 12:33.586
I can't believe you!

12:33.586 --> 12:36.422
Don't you forget that you're
in my body, all right!

12:36.422 --> 12:39.425
What about you? Don't you talk
with weird girlie language, either!

12:39.425 --> 12:41.093
- Hey, Nina...
- Hey, Nina...

12:41.093 --> 12:41.761
Huh?

12:41.761 --> 12:43.763
Come on, let's go change!

12:43.763 --> 12:46.432
Remember today's first class
is P.E. at the pool.

12:46.432 --> 12:47.767
Pool?

12:47.767 --> 12:48.768
Change?

12:48.768 --> 12:50.759
No! No! No!

12:51.771 --> 12:53.773
What are you talking about, Zero?

12:53.773 --> 12:55.775
Come on, dude, let's go.

12:55.775 --> 12:57.443
Oh, no!!!!

12:57.443 --> 12:59.104
Nooooo!!!

13:01.781 --> 13:03.783
What's wrong, Zero?

13:03.783 --> 13:05.785
Why are you so stiffened?

13:05.785 --> 13:10.119
Noooooo! Don't touch me!
Don't come near me! Don't talk to me!

13:12.124 --> 13:13.125
Nina-chan!

13:13.125 --> 13:13.793
"Nina"?

13:13.793 --> 13:14.782
Oops!

13:15.795 --> 13:16.796
I mean Nina's cousin, Zero!

13:16.796 --> 13:18.457
Whatever dude.

13:20.466 --> 13:21.801
What are you doing, Nina?

13:21.801 --> 13:23.636
Being hunched up like that in the corner...

13:23.636 --> 13:26.472
Oh, umm, I was just...

13:26.472 --> 13:27.807
You'll be late.

13:27.807 --> 13:31.811
Hey, don't touch me!
Don't come near me! Don't talk to-

13:31.811 --> 13:35.474
Huh? Wha! Wha!!

13:40.820 --> 13:41.821
Nina! Nina!

13:41.821 --> 13:43.823
What the... She's bleeding from the nose!

13:43.823 --> 13:44.812
- Why?
- Why?

13:46.826 --> 13:49.158
- Yaay!
- Good luck!
- You can do it!

13:50.329 --> 13:53.165
Are you okay, Ni... I meant, Zero?

13:53.165 --> 13:56.498
I'm not that okay...

13:56.836 --> 13:59.872
- Nina, you're awesome!
- Nina is so fast!

13:59.872 --> 14:02.238
- She's so fast!
- Cool!

14:05.845 --> 14:06.834
Piece of cake!

14:09.181 --> 14:12.685
Zero! Zero! Zero! I meant, Nina!

14:12.685 --> 14:16.522
Try not to draw... Don't you
draw too much attention, you hear?

14:16.522 --> 14:19.525
It'll be fine!
Hey, why don't you swim, too?

14:19.525 --> 14:23.859
No, stop it, I can't swi...
I mean, damn it! I can't swim!

14:25.865 --> 14:27.856
H-Help... Me...

14:28.868 --> 14:32.771
Wow, I didn't know Zero
swims like a hammer...

14:32.771 --> 14:36.542
On the other hand, today Nina is so...

14:36.542 --> 14:37.877
- Rooooooar!
- Cool!

14:37.877 --> 14:39.545
She's invincible!

14:39.545 --> 14:40.880
Move, move, move, move!

14:40.880 --> 14:43.215
Hey, Nina-chan!
That's the men's bathroom!

14:43.215 --> 14:45.217
But I won't make it!

14:45.217 --> 14:46.886
So she went inside the men's bathroom?

14:46.886 --> 14:48.888
- Nina-chan is invincible!
- Nina-chan is invincible!

14:48.888 --> 14:49.889
Hey...

14:49.889 --> 14:52.892
She's eating her lunch before lunch hour!
Nina-chan is invincible!

14:52.892 --> 14:57.563
Whoa! She's sleeping during the class!
Nina-chan is invincible!

14:57.563 --> 14:59.899
Whenever you don't understand
the question, just be a man and say...

14:59.899 --> 15:00.900
I don't know!

15:00.900 --> 15:03.569
That's how you do it!
Nina-chan is invincible!

15:03.569 --> 15:05.237
Nina-chan is invincible!

15:05.237 --> 15:06.906
She'll just take it in one
handful and then... Toss!

15:06.906 --> 15:07.907
Toss!

15:07.907 --> 15:10.239
Toss! That's how she does it!

15:13.913 --> 15:15.574
Nina-chan is invincible!

15:16.916 --> 15:18.247
Absolutely invincible!

15:19.585 --> 15:22.922
Today is the day of
Nina Yamada's invincible legend!

15:22.922 --> 15:25.925
What? You mean that Nina?
It's unbelievable!

15:25.925 --> 15:27.092
That's so cool!

15:27.092 --> 15:28.928
Exactly! She's awesome!

15:28.928 --> 15:30.930
- Yaay!
- She's invincible!

15:30.930 --> 15:32.591
She's invincible!

15:34.266 --> 15:36.936
Give me a break!
It'd be so embarrassing

15:36.936 --> 15:39.104
if people make this invincible
legend crap about me at school!

15:39.104 --> 15:41.607
I can't take this anymore!
I just want to go back to normal!

15:41.607 --> 15:45.611
No, actually, you might be better off
staying like that until the test is over.

15:45.611 --> 15:46.946
What are you talking about?

15:46.946 --> 15:48.080
Don't you think so?

15:48.080 --> 15:51.951
If you stay as Nina-chan,
you could fight off those examiners,

15:51.951 --> 15:54.954
who would come attacking her
just like how you did today.

15:54.954 --> 15:56.956
There would be no guarding method
that's more perfect than that.

15:56.956 --> 15:58.958
- That makes sense!
- No, it doesn't!

15:58.958 --> 16:01.961
You've got to be kidding me!
Staying this way until Christmas?

16:01.961 --> 16:04.964
She's right! There's no way!
I'm not going to stay like this!

16:04.964 --> 16:06.298
- Ichii!!
- Ichii!!

16:06.298 --> 16:08.233
I've looked into it, and it looks like

16:08.233 --> 16:10.636
you're in the state where
your hearts have been switched.

16:10.636 --> 16:15.107
It says that in this case you
have to get closer to each other

16:15.107 --> 16:16.976
in order to put everything back to normal.

16:16.976 --> 16:17.977
We have to...

16:17.977 --> 16:19.638
Get closer?

16:23.649 --> 16:24.984
Nothing changed.

16:24.984 --> 16:26.986
No, nothing changed.

16:26.986 --> 16:29.318
Do we have to get even closer?

16:31.657 --> 16:32.658
Huh?

16:32.658 --> 16:33.993
Hey, stay back, Zero!

16:33.993 --> 16:37.997
Shut up! We have no choice!
Don't you want to go back to normal?

16:37.997 --> 16:40.329
But that doesn't mean you have to!

16:45.337 --> 16:46.672
Nanase?

16:46.672 --> 16:50.009
Looks like you're in big trouble,
Zero, Nina-chan!

16:50.009 --> 16:51.677
Don't tell me you did this!

16:51.677 --> 16:54.013
You guessed it right!
It's done by my curse card magic!

16:54.013 --> 16:55.347
You haven't noticed?

16:55.347 --> 16:57.683
My curse card magic uses cards.

16:57.683 --> 16:58.517
Cards?

16:58.517 --> 16:59.351
That's right!

16:59.351 --> 17:00.519
Guess what these care!

17:00.519 --> 17:01.020
- Hey!
- Hey!

17:01.020 --> 17:02.354
That's what you put on me!

17:02.354 --> 17:05.691
Bingo! And you flip it over...

17:05.691 --> 17:07.693
Oh, no! The card is hidden on the back?

17:07.693 --> 17:11.196
So hitting Nina-chan with the ball
during the beach volleyball match

17:11.196 --> 17:13.032
was also a part of your plot?

17:13.032 --> 17:16.035
Ding-ding-ding! This is the card
that can switch the person,

17:16.035 --> 17:18.337
who wears it and the person,
who peels it off over night.

17:18.337 --> 17:20.706
Considering how jealous Zero could get,

17:20.706 --> 17:22.374
I figured that
he'd definitely peel it off

17:22.374 --> 17:24.710
if he saw either Yakumo
or I put it on her!

17:24.710 --> 17:27.713
Damn it! Why did you even
think of such a ridiculous plot?

17:27.713 --> 17:29.381
But you fell for it!

17:29.381 --> 17:30.382
Err...

17:30.382 --> 17:32.051
I'll tell you something good!

17:32.051 --> 17:33.552
This magic will become permanent

17:33.552 --> 17:39.758
unless you dispel it within 24 hours,
basically within another 10 minutes!

17:39.758 --> 17:42.061
- What? Within another 10 minutes?
- What? Within another 10 minutes?

17:42.061 --> 17:43.896
You son of a bitch!
Stop screwing us around!

17:43.896 --> 17:45.230
Turn us back to normal!

17:45.230 --> 17:48.634
Sure, I'll do it in exchange
for the Crystal Pearl!

17:48.634 --> 17:51.904
Also there's another condition.

17:51.904 --> 17:54.239
I want Zero to admit that
I've got him and apologize to me!

17:54.239 --> 17:55.074
What?

17:55.074 --> 17:58.911
What did you say? What makes you
think I'd say stuff like that, Nanase?

17:58.911 --> 18:00.579
But you know what, Zero?

18:00.579 --> 18:03.082
I wonder how long you can afford
to be so stubborn like that!

18:03.082 --> 18:04.083
What?

18:04.083 --> 18:06.919
Here, take a look! 8 minutes.

18:06.919 --> 18:09.922
In another 8 minutes you two
will permanently stay switched!

18:09.922 --> 18:12.091
What? What should we do?
What should we do, Zero?

18:12.091 --> 18:13.926
Just say you're sorry!

18:13.926 --> 18:16.095
Humph! I will never say that!

18:16.095 --> 18:18.263
Zero, it's not the time
to be stubborn right now.

18:18.263 --> 18:22.768
But I will never say I'm sorry!
If I ever had to admit my defeat

18:22.768 --> 18:24.770
I'd rather stay this way
for the rest of my life!

18:24.770 --> 18:26.105
Zero...

18:26.105 --> 18:32.772
What do I do... I don't want to stay like
this forever or go stay with those two...

18:34.947 --> 18:36.115
Nina...

18:36.115 --> 18:39.785
Crap! How dare they make Nina cry?

18:39.785 --> 18:43.122
What are you going to do?
Are you going to apologize or not?

18:43.122 --> 18:44.790
You don't have time
to be thinking about it!

18:44.790 --> 18:46.625
3 more minutes!

18:46.625 --> 18:48.127
All right!

18:48.127 --> 18:49.128
All right, Nanase!

18:49.128 --> 18:50.129
What?

18:50.129 --> 18:53.132
I'm going to say it right now
so listen up and listen good!

18:53.132 --> 18:55.134
So you finally decided, huh?

18:55.134 --> 18:56.135
I'm going to say it!

18:56.135 --> 18:57.469
Go ahead!

18:57.469 --> 19:01.140
All right, you've got me!
I admit that I lost!

19:01.140 --> 19:03.809
Got it, Nanase? Now what do you say?

19:03.809 --> 19:06.745
Ugh, the way you apologized
was totally annoying!

19:06.745 --> 19:08.144
But oh well...

19:09.148 --> 19:11.817
The Crystal Pearl is now mine!

19:11.817 --> 19:13.152
No way... Zero...

19:13.152 --> 19:15.154
What else do you want me to do, Nina?

19:15.154 --> 19:20.993
But remember, even after you go stay with
them we will definitely come rescue you!

19:20.993 --> 19:24.163
So just trust me and wait!

19:24.163 --> 19:25.697
Zero...

19:25.697 --> 19:27.166
Now turn us back to normal!

19:27.166 --> 19:29.168
I know!

19:29.168 --> 19:32.171
All right then. Here I go!

19:32.171 --> 19:35.163
Curse card magic! Magical Reverse!

19:43.182 --> 19:44.683
All right!

19:44.683 --> 19:46.518
Now we're back to normal...

19:46.518 --> 19:48.187
- Huh? We're not!
- Huh? We're not!

19:48.187 --> 19:49.188
What's going on?

19:49.188 --> 19:53.181
Huh? Did I use the wrong card?
Oh, it's this one! Magical Reverse!

19:54.193 --> 19:56.195
Huh? It's weird...

19:56.195 --> 20:00.032
Magical Reverse! Magical Reverse!
Magical Reverse!

20:00.032 --> 20:02.201
- Nanase...
- Nanase-kun...

20:02.201 --> 20:03.869
Don't tell me you...

20:03.869 --> 20:07.206
Tee-hee! I forgot how
to turn it back to normal!

20:07.206 --> 20:08.607
- Seriously?
- Seriously?

20:08.607 --> 20:11.210
Then that means I admitted
my defeat for nothing?

20:11.210 --> 20:13.545
Zero, it's not the time to be
worrying about stuff like that!

20:13.545 --> 20:15.214
R-Right...

20:15.214 --> 20:17.916
Ichii, please do something!

20:17.916 --> 20:19.484
No matter how many times I look
at it the answer is the same.

20:19.484 --> 20:21.553
The answer is for you to get closer!

20:21.553 --> 20:24.556
But we did just that,
but it didn't work at all!

20:24.556 --> 20:27.059
So what does
"getting even closer than that" mean?

20:27.059 --> 20:28.227
Zero...

20:28.227 --> 20:32.231
Oh, that's right. I shouldn't
keep on panicking like this.

20:32.231 --> 20:35.234
Nina must be a lot
more scared than I am...

20:35.234 --> 20:39.571
Oh yeah, I need to
consider more about Nina.

20:39.571 --> 20:43.234
Not just about me,
but more about Nina...

20:45.244 --> 20:47.913
I see! "Getting even closer" must mean...

20:47.913 --> 20:49.748
Nina, come over here!

20:49.748 --> 20:53.418
And think about me!
I'll think about you, too!

20:53.418 --> 20:56.255
Wh-What are you talking
at a time like this, Zero?

20:56.255 --> 20:58.590
What do you mean by that anyway?

20:58.590 --> 21:01.260
Hey, Zero! Zero!

21:01.260 --> 21:03.262
Listen to me. Our bodies
aren't the only things

21:03.262 --> 21:06.765
that can get closer to each other.
Our hearts and feelings...

21:06.765 --> 21:09.359
My feeling that I have for you, too!

21:10.602 --> 21:15.274
So think about me.
I'll think about you, too!

21:15.274 --> 21:18.266
I'll think about only you
just like I always do!

21:19.611 --> 21:21.272
Zero...

21:25.117 --> 21:27.950
Nina... Nina...

21:30.956 --> 21:33.792
Our bodies aren't the only things
that can get closer to each other.

21:33.792 --> 21:38.630
Our hearts and feelings...
The feeling to care about each other...

21:38.630 --> 21:45.297
I have faith in you, Zero...
that you would always come help me...

21:46.805 --> 21:53.312
I have faith in your feelings, too...
that you would always watch over me...

21:53.312 --> 21:54.313
Zero...

21:54.313 --> 21:55.981
Nina...

21:55.981 --> 21:58.317
Bodies aren't the only things
that could come closer...

21:58.317 --> 22:00.986
Something much more important...

22:00.986 --> 22:03.488
Something that the two of us
must bring closer to one another...

22:03.488 --> 22:06.658
That is our hearts!

22:06.658 --> 22:07.989
- Zero!
- Nina!

22:20.005 --> 22:20.839
Zero?

22:20.839 --> 22:22.341
Nina...

22:22.341 --> 22:23.342
So this means...

22:23.342 --> 22:25.010
Nanase!

22:25.010 --> 22:27.679
Nanase!!

22:27.679 --> 22:29.348
What are you doing, acting on your own?

22:29.348 --> 22:31.683
I told you not to put Nina
in danger, didn't I?

22:31.683 --> 22:34.353
Nina, Zero, Ichii!
I'm sorry about this whole incident!

22:34.353 --> 22:35.354
We were wrong for that.

22:35.354 --> 22:37.923
If you were there you
should've done something then!

22:37.923 --> 22:40.359
As a man I will take
responsibility with good grace!

22:40.359 --> 22:42.361
We will train over from the beginning!

22:42.361 --> 22:45.353
Well, then, Nina-chan! We'll be back!

22:47.366 --> 22:49.368
I won't give up on the Crystal Pearl!

22:49.368 --> 22:54.373
Wait for me till then! Be good!
Zero, Ichii, don't forget to take a bath!

22:54.373 --> 22:56.541
Humph! It'd be the same thing
no matter how many times they come!

22:56.541 --> 22:58.377
- We will protect Nina!
- We will protect Nina!

22:58.377 --> 23:01.713
Thank you, Zero.
Looks like you saved me again.

23:01.713 --> 23:07.386
After all I guess only Nina
can make Nina's smile, huh?

23:07.386 --> 23:09.388
I can say the same about yours, too.

23:09.388 --> 23:10.555
Not just anyone else,

23:10.555 --> 23:13.725
but you make that smile and
that's what makes it so great, Zero.

23:13.725 --> 23:16.395
Zero, I heard your voice loud and clear.

23:16.395 --> 23:19.731
Me, too. Your voice made it into my heart.

23:19.731 --> 23:20.399
Yeah.

23:20.399 --> 23:21.900
But you know what?
It doesn't really make

23:21.900 --> 23:23.735
any difference even
if we're switched, huh?

23:23.735 --> 23:25.737
What doesn't?

23:25.737 --> 23:27.329
The size of your boobs!

23:28.407 --> 23:31.240
You jerk! Jerk!

23:32.411 --> 23:34.746
My prince...

23:34.746 --> 23:38.083
I heard it in my heart...

23:38.083 --> 23:40.074
Your voice...

23:44.423 --> 23:47.259
Pit-a-pat, skip! Parallel pop!

23:47.259 --> 23:50.228
Pit-a-pat, step! Miracle kiss!

23:50.228 --> 23:53.254
Pit-a-pat, magical! Lollipop!

24:02.040 --> 24:07.846
My heart is beating so fast.
He might notice.

24:07.846 --> 24:13.652
My heart is pounding and throbbing.
It feels like it's going to burst.

24:13.652 --> 24:19.524
No matter which direction
I look, his eyes are crystals.

24:19.524 --> 24:25.430
They are so brilliant
that I just look away.

24:25.430 --> 24:31.269
The seed of love has begun to sprout.
Even my magic, too! Check it out!

24:31.269 --> 24:39.744
They will keep on growing
and spinning and explode!

24:39.744 --> 24:45.417
Popping lollipop. Save me, lollipop!
Throbbing heart.

24:45.417 --> 24:51.723
Two candies, I can't decide
which one is better.

24:51.723 --> 24:57.629
Even the earth turns the other way,
if you hold me,

24:57.629 --> 25:03.468
the shape of my heart will change
just like pit-a-pat!

25:03.468 --> 25:09.065
The shape of my heart will change
just like pit-a-pat! Lollipop!

25:12.511 --> 25:15.180
Go ahead, Zero.

25:15.180 --> 25:17.182
You can kiss me...

25:17.182 --> 25:18.513
Nina...

25:19.518 --> 25:21.853
All right, here I come! Ready?

25:21.853 --> 25:23.522
I found you, Zero!!

25:23.522 --> 25:25.190
Eek! You are!

25:25.190 --> 25:28.593
How could you do this to me when you
already have me? Who is that girl?

25:28.593 --> 25:30.462
Who are you?

25:30.462 --> 25:32.664
I am Zero's fiancée!

25:32.664 --> 25:35.600
Next time on Save Me! Lollipop,
"Here Comes His Fiancée!"

25:35.600 --> 25:37.536
I hate you, Zero!

25:37.536 --> 25:39.197
Nina!
